 filtered list per point. Velocity is fixed across the six sweeps; filters refresh
-at a frame boundary or cell change. Original cell order, descending line ids,
+at a frame boundary or cell change. Cached cell interiors use conservative world
+bounds to avoid repeated coordinate division. The margin derives from the bounded
+integer-cell domain and binary64 precision; boundary and out-of-domain queries
